Dear Ms Fadenruh,

The attached extract is still the current one. The 300 shares and the 250 sha=
res are two separate holdings. There is no double counting between them. The =
four other holders together own the remaining 450 shares. I have received no =
signed transfer since I prepared this extract.

The director's reference to a possible sale came from a conversation over lun=
ch. It was not a shareholder resolution and did not change our register. Neit=
her investor has instructed me to change the address for notices.

I checked the identity forms again this morning. The birth dates and addresse=
s for both investors match the explicitly fictional record supplied in your e=
nquiry. I cannot say when your bank will finish its review. Please use the fu=
ll extract rather than the cropped diagram from the presentation.

Kind regards,
